{"seq":3,"slug":"inline-classes","title":"内联类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/inline-classes","wordCount":761,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"内联类\">内联类</h1><p>内联类（Inline Classes）是 Kotlin 提供的一种零开销抽象机制。通过 <code>@JvmInline value class</code> 声明，编译器会在可能的情况下将包装类型内联为底层类型，避免堆分配的开销，同时保留类型安全性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内联类的核心是<strong>零开销的类型包装</strong>：<code>@JvmInline value class</code> 在源码层面提供一个独立、可校验的类型，而在编译后多数场景下被替换为底层类型，从而避免堆分配。类型安全与运行时开销这对通常互斥的诉求，在这里被编译器同时满足——代价是泛型参数、可空类型、接口类型等场景仍会触发<strong>装箱</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本语法\">基本语法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@JvmInline&#10;value class UserId(val id: Long)&#10;&#10;@JvmInline&#10;value class Email(val address: String)&#10;&#10;fun findUser(id: UserId): String = &quot;User#${id.id}&quot;&#10;&#10;val userId = UserId(42L)&#10;println(findUser(userId)) // User#42\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class UserId(val id: Long)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class Email(val address: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun findUser(id: UserId): String = \"User#${id.id}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val userId = UserId(42L)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(findUser(userId)) // User#42</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>@JvmInline</code> 注解是 JVM 平台的要求。<code>value class</code> 是 Kotlin 1.5+ 的语法，替代了早期的 <code>inline class</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"编译后的表示\">编译后的表示</h2><p>内联类在编译后，大多数场景下会被替换为底层类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@JvmInline&#10;value class Password(val value: String)&#10;&#10;fun validate(password: Password): Boolean {&#10;    return password.value.length &gt;= 8&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 编译后大致等价于：&#10;// fun validate(password: String): Boolean {&#10;//     return password.length &gt;= 8&#10;// }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class Password(val value: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun validate(password: Password): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return password.value.length >= 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译后大致等价于：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// fun validate(password: String): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     return password.length >= 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// }</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Password(#quot;abc123#quot;)&quot;] --&gt;|编译时内联| B[&quot;#quot;abc123#quot;&quot;]&#10;    C[源码层面有类型区分] --&gt; D[运行时零额外开销]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Password(#quot;abc123#quot;)\"] --&gt;|编译时内联| B[\"#quot;abc123#quot;\"]\n    C[源码层面有类型区分] --&gt; D[运行时零额外开销]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"装箱-boxing-触发场景\">装箱（Boxing）触发场景</h2><p>并非所有情况内联类都能被拆箱。以下场景会触发装箱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否装箱</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作为具体类型直接使用</td>\n<td>❌ 不装箱</td>\n<td>编译器内联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作为泛型类型参数</td>\n<td>✅ 装箱</td>\n<td>类型擦除需要对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作为可空类型 <code>UserId?</code></td>\n<td>✅ 装箱</td>\n<td>需要表示 null</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作为接口类型</td>\n<td>✅ 装箱</td>\n<td>需要对象引用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@JvmInline&#10;value class Name(val value: String)&#10;&#10;fun direct(name: Name) { }         // 不装箱：参数为 String&#10;fun nullable(name: Name?) { }      // 装箱：需要可空包装&#10;fun generic(item: Any) { }         // 装箱：擦除为 Any&#10;fun &lt;T&gt; genericFun(item: T) { }    // 装箱：擦除\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class Name(val value: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun direct(name: Name) { }         // 不装箱：参数为 String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun nullable(name: Name?) { }      // 装箱：需要可空包装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun generic(item: Any) { }         // 装箱：擦除为 Any</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun &#x3C;T> genericFun(item: T) { }    // 装箱：擦除</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"内联类的能力\">内联类的能力</h2><p>内联类虽然轻量，但仍支持丰富的类特性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@JvmInline&#10;value class Percentage(val value: Double) {&#10;    init {&#10;        require(value in 0.0..100.0) { &quot;百分比必须在 0-100 之间&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun toFraction(): Double = value / 100.0&#10;&#10;    override fun toString(): String = &quot;${value}%&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;val p = Percentage(85.0)&#10;println(p)              // 85.0%&#10;println(p.toFraction()) // 0.85\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class Percentage(val value: Double) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    init {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(value in 0.0..100.0) { \"百分比必须在 0-100 之间\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun toFraction(): Double = value / 100.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun toString(): String = \"${value}%\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val p = Percentage(85.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(p)              // 85.0%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(p.toFraction()) // 0.85</span></span></code></pre></div><p>内联类可以实现接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface Printable {&#10;    fun prettyPrint(): String&#10;}&#10;&#10;@JvmInline&#10;value class Color(val rgb: Int) : Printable {&#10;    override fun prettyPrint(): String = &quot;#${rgb.toString(16).padStart(6, &#39;0&#39;)}&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface Printable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun prettyPrint(): String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class Color(val rgb: Int) : Printable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun prettyPrint(): String = \"#${rgb.toString(16).padStart(6, '0')}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"内联类-vs-类型别名\">内联类 vs 类型别名</h2><p>类型别名（<code>typealias</code>）和内联类都可以为已有类型创建新名称，但它们有本质区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th><code>typealias</code></th>\n<th><code>value class</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>❌ 只是别名，可互换</td>\n<td>✅ 独立类型，不可互换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时开销</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>几乎无（偶尔装箱）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可定义方法</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可实现接口</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可添加 init 验证</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"typealias Meters = Double&#10;@JvmInline&#10;value class Kilograms(val value: Double)&#10;&#10;fun demo() {&#10;    val distance: Meters = 100.0&#10;    val weight: Double = distance    // 合法：typealias 没有类型安全&#10;&#10;    val kg = Kilograms(70.0)&#10;    // val d: Double = kg            // 编译错误：value class 有类型安全&#10;    val d: Double = kg.value         // 必须显式访问&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>typealias Meters = Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class Kilograms(val value: Double)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun demo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val distance: Meters = 100.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val weight: Double = distance    // 合法：typealias 没有类型安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val kg = Kilograms(70.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // val d: Double = kg            // 编译错误：value class 有类型安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val d: Double = kg.value         // 必须显式访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需要新类型名称?] --&gt; B{需要类型安全?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[typealias]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{需要方法/验证?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[value class 基础用法]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[value class 带方法和 init]\">flowchart TD\n    A[需要新类型名称?] --&gt; B{需要类型安全?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[typealias]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{需要方法/验证?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[value class 基础用法]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[value class 带方法和 init]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能对比\">性能对比</h2><p>内联类相比普通包装类在性能上有显著优势：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 普通包装类 — 每次创建都分配堆对象&#10;data class WrappedId(val id: Long)&#10;&#10;// 内联类 — 编译后直接使用 Long&#10;@JvmInline&#10;value class InlinedId(val id: Long)&#10;&#10;fun benchmarkExample() {&#10;    // WrappedId: 分配 1_000_000 个对象&#10;    val wrappedList = List(1_000_000) { WrappedId(it.toLong()) }&#10;&#10;    // InlinedId: 本质是 Long 数组，零额外分配&#10;    val inlinedList = List(1_000_000) { InlinedId(it.toLong()) }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 普通包装类 — 每次创建都分配堆对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class WrappedId(val id: Long)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 内联类 — 编译后直接使用 Long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class InlinedId(val id: Long)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun benchmarkExample() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // WrappedId: 分配 1_000_000 个对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val wrappedList = List(1_000_000) { WrappedId(it.toLong()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // InlinedId: 本质是 Long 数组，零额外分配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val inlinedList = List(1_000_000) { InlinedId(it.toLong()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在高频创建轻量包装对象的场景（如 ID、度量单位、货币金额），内联类能显著减少 GC 压力。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"限制与注意事项\">限制与注意事项</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>只能有一个构造参数</strong>：内联类的主构造函数必须恰好有一个 <code>val</code> 属性</li>\n<li><strong>不能有 backing field</strong>：不能声明额外的 <code>var</code> 或带 backing field 的属性</li>\n<li><strong>不能参与继承</strong>：不能是 <code>open</code>、<code>abstract</code>，也不能继承其他类</li>\n<li><strong>名称改写（name mangling）</strong>：编译器会对接受内联类参数的函数进行名称改写，避免签名冲突</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@JvmInline&#10;value class UInt(val value: Int)&#10;&#10;// 编译后函数名可能被改写为 compute-&lt;hash&gt;(int)&#10;fun compute(x: UInt): Int = x.value * 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@JvmInline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value class UInt(val value: Int)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译后函数名可能被改写为 compute-&#x3C;hash>(int)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun compute(x: UInt): Int = x.value * 2</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>内联类</strong>通过 <code>@JvmInline value class</code> 声明，提供零开销的类型包装</li>\n<li>编译器在大多数场景下将内联类替换为底层类型，避免堆分配</li>\n<li>泛型参数、可空类型、接口类型等场景会触发<strong>装箱</strong></li>\n<li>与 <code>typealias</code> 相比，内联类提供真正的<strong>类型安全</strong>，且支持方法和验证逻辑</li>\n<li>适用于 ID、度量单位、货币等需要类型区分但不想付出对象分配代价的场景</li>\n<li>限制包括：单构造参数、无 backing field、不可继承</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内联类","id":"内联类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本语法","id":"基本语法"},{"level":2,"text":"编译后的表示","id":"编译后的表示"},{"level":2,"text":"装箱（Boxing）触发场景","id":"装箱-boxing-触发场景"},{"level":2,"text":"内联类的能力","id":"内联类的能力"},{"level":2,"text":"内联类 vs 类型别名","id":"内联类-vs-类型别名"},{"level":2,"text":"性能对比","id":"性能对比"},{"level":2,"text":"限制与注意事项","id":"限制与注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型投影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/type-projections"},"next":{"title":"密封层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/sealed-hierarchies"}}